msgid ""
"OpenStack is running in production all around the globe resulting in a large "
"group of people who's daily job is to deploy and operate the platform."
msgstr ""
"OpenStack is running in production all around the globe resulting in a large "
"group of people who's daily job is to deploy and operate the platform."

